    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9764" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concăvo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			id., <i>to make hollow, to hollow out,
				make round</i> (very rare): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bracchia in arcus,</span>”
				<i>to curve, bend</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 195</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">manus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Nemes. Ecl. 3, 49</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concavati nidi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 5, 11</span></i>
			.</div>
